              "content": "Every untracked repository's screen is the full view, at one address, however it was reached: search, a typed name, a link, a row of my work (D34). Same toolbar, List and Board, state filter, grouping and sort as a tracked one, plus \"not tracked\" and how much is read. It is read on demand and never in the background. Tracking starts from ⌘K, \"Track repository\", or in Settings; the screen has no button for it. Both layouts apply (tabs drawn here, CH4's column works the same).",
