                      "content": "A link to a comment (…/issues/12#issuecomment-5) opens the item scrolled to that comment, and while the address names it the comment is outlined: 1 px $accent, radius 8, nothing else. The outline is drawn outside the comment, 6 px above and below and 8 px to the sides, so marking it moves nothing: neither the comment's own text nor its neighbours. It stays as long as the fragment is in the address and goes on K/J, on opening another item and on closing; no animation, no new text. The same in the panel, the modal and the page. Left: the item view's Latest activity today, the middle comment linked. Right: the same mark on the thread's card, which only changes its border colour.",
