              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "From the first visit to landing on My work. After GitHub the app first asks whether saved settings exist: if so G11 takes G2's place, otherwise G2 offers saving, unticked. The choosing screens share the app's 36px window strip, without a step indicator (G15 on the Mac). \"Track these\" goes straight to My work, which says itself what is still arriving (G16, G17); the download page (G6) is retired. The organisation that hides its private repositories (G5) is the failure that must be visible: it appears on the tracking step and in Settings. Tracking later and the account moved to App · Settings (G8, G9).",
