                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The filter also asks GitHub, as Search repositories… in the command menu does (E8): from two typed characters, once typing pauses, GitHub's qualifiers included. Your own matches come first; GitHub's results follow under On GitHub, and tick like any other row, so someone else's repository is tracked from the same list. A typed owner/name finds that one repository. Rows already in your lists are not repeated there. The same chooser serves Settings (T18), so this works there too, and G10's input for a name becomes this search.",
