              "name": "Description",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The desktop app signs in with GitHub's OAuth Device Flow: no redirect back into the app. githq shows a short code, opens github.com/login/device in the system browser, and waits while the user approves there. Unlike the web, which has the landing page in front of GitHub's consent screen and no screen of its own, the desktop app opens with nothing to sign in from, so it keeps one: a short explanation up front and one button on Enter.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
