              "content": "The desktop app has two update streams, chosen per device: Stable, released by hand now and then, and Development, a build of every push to main. It looks for updates and downloads them in the background, then says so quietly and waits: no modal, no countdown, never a forced restart. After an update a toast says so, and what changed opens from it. U1 is the status bar's offer; U2 was not chosen.",
