              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Replaces U1's offer in the status bar, which was too easy to miss (owner, 2026-11-06). Once an update has downloaded, a pinned toast says so: Restart (⌥R) or Dismiss. Dismiss is U1's Later: the toast comes back on the next launch or the next Check for updates. While the toast shows, the status bar says nothing about it; once dismissed, a quiet \"githq X ready · Restart\" stays at its right end, so a restart is one click away. Checking, downloading and a manual check's outcome stay in the status bar (U22).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
