                      "content": "Restart was clicked and the system's password prompt was refused or cancelled. Amber, since something the user asked for didn't happen, in the same place as the offer, with Try again in Restart's place. Later hides it until the next launch, as in U1; quitting won't install it on Linux, so the offer comes back then. Commands in ⌘K follow: Try again and Later.",
