              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Noticing a broken workflow and finding out why. A total in the sidebar and a marker on the repository, one screen with everything broken, a Workflows section per repository, and the failed run as a full page built around reading its log from the keyboard. Attention follows news, not state: for its first 24 hours a break is bright red, after that it settles to a quiet red, and it stays until a run passes.",
