                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Just tracked. The list of workflows arrived, the runs are still being read. A row with no verdict says “Reading…”, with an empty strip and no green and no zero. The section shows a dash instead of a count until the read has finished, and the status bar counts it: “Reading runs · 2 of 6 workflows”. Before the list itself arrives, W16.",
