                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "⌘K on the run. Re-running failed jobs comes first, its detail naming the jobs (“1 job: build”, “2 jobs: build, lint”), and has no key on purpose: neither the page nor the menu gives it one. Open on GitHub keeps its key. Someone without permission to re-run doesn't see the command, as with every edit githq knows they can't make. Only commands that make sense in a menu are listed: the log's movement keys (J, E, N and so on) are in the help sheet, not here.",
