                      "content": "GitHub refused or Actions is turned off. Not healthy, and not in the total. The wording follows the cause: “Actions is switched off here”, or “GitHub refused to list its workflows (403)” with “GET …/actions/workflows → 403”. The section's count is a dash. If runs were read before, the last known rows stay below this message (W17).",
