                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "After W9. The Alerts bar says in words that failures here never mark the repository broken, so its red rows read as expected. No alerts comes first, as nothing else says these failures; every failing workflow sits there, Deploy on main included, with the same quiet red as any failure that isn't news. The section has no count, and the sidebar no marker for it. Here CLA's last runs all passed, so its row reads “None of the last 5 failed”; with a single run, “The last run passed”.",
