                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Here that is #1206, third of four. The bar is pinned under the toolbar, with the rows at the top of the content. The entry stays collapsed and its tall pip says where you are. The one above answers K, the one below J: the key sits right after the title, so moving it changes nothing else on the row.",
