                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The bar sits under the toolbar and never moves, folds or changes height: the stack's name and one square per pull request, numbered by its place, the open one with a full outline and a mark under it. Under the bar, at the top of the content, the rows: every pull request of the stack, none folded, K and J right after the neighbours' titles (the states stay aligned, so nothing shifts as the keys move), and what stops the stack. No merge here: ⇧M opens the merge panel. They're content, so they scroll away under the bar. The unfold chevron sits right after the stack's name and is hidden while the rows are in view; nothing follows it, so nothing shifts when it shows.",
