                      "content": "Nothing folds and nothing jumps: the rows simply scrolled away under the bar. Once they're out of view the chevron appears right after the stack's name. A click on a square opens that pull request (the panel goes to its top, rows in view); hovering one names it in the browser's own tooltip: its place, number and title. K and J still walk to the neighbours.",
