                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The left column is one column with one width, whichever layout and section: the repository's column here, the branch and tag list in the tabs layout. Dragging its edge, or ←/→ on the focused edge, sets it from 200 to 480 px, 280 by default, kept on this device as other panel widths. The line lights up while hovered, dragged or focused, like the sidebar's and the item panel's. On a small window the column gives way, down to 200 px, so the pane keeps 400 px, and the width chosen comes back with the room.",
