                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Red twice and nowhere else: the commit's dot in the graph and the red ✕ right after its pull request. The headline stays in its usual colour. Running is amber in both places; passing is a quiet green check; no checks, nothing. The pull request, the CI and the author sit right after the headline, so they are read with it; only the author and the age are aligned at the right edge.",
