                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "↵ on release/4.2 (found with B, then \"rel\", CH25) scrolls the graph so its commit sits a third of the way down and selects it. The filter clears and the focus is back in the graph, so the next ↵ opens that commit's details and J and K go on from there (CH26). Nothing is filtered out of the graph.",
