              "name": "Group note",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "fitloop/webapp's clone at ~/Dev/webapp has five working copies: the main checkout and four worktrees, each with an agent in it. Each sits in the graph as a marker on the commit it has checked out, with its count of uncommitted changes, and in the list nested under its branch. Local branches carry how far they are ahead of GitHub (↑1) or that they are only local. A worktree checked out on a bare commit (quiet-heron) has no branch, so only the graph shows it.",
