                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A worktree shows in the list as a row nested under the branch it has checked out: its folder's name and its count of uncommitted changes. In the graph it is a marker on its commit. The list stays one list of branches and tags. A worktree on a bare commit (quiet-heron) has no branch, so it is found in the graph only, where its marker sits on the commit it has checked out.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
