              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A worktree's menu opens from its marker in the graph (a click) and from its row in the list (. or a right-click). It holds what can be done to the working copy without writing to the repository: for a start, revealing its folder. The menu is where the list of actions grows.",
