                      "content": "The user picked ~/Code/webapp-2, a second, separate clone of fitloop/webapp. githq keeps one clone per repository, so it refuses, names the folder already added, and offers to remove that one; adding again afterwards works. A worktree of the first clone would have been added without a word (CD5).",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
