              "content": "Reading a pull request's changes file by file, every thread where it belongs, and writing the review. A page of its own, full screen, entered with D from an opened pull request; J and K walk the stack as everywhere else. Screens are CR-numbered. Where there are variants the recommended one comes first and the choice is the owner's; amber frames are open questions. Brief: docs/design/code-review/ui/review-a-pull-request.md. Decisions: docs/design/code-review/DECISIONS.md.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
