                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "No checkboxes in the list: they read like the folder icons. A file sits indented under its folder, and a viewed one has a small eye right after its name, the name slightly dimmed. Open threads count in amber (engine.ts). A file whose threads are all resolved shows their count in grey (client.ts), so a past discussion can be found; a file with no threads shows nothing. Ticking happens on the file's header (Viewed V) or with V; status icons (loading, failed, waiting) sit at the row's right end.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
