                      "id": "dRMVx",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The list arrives first, with every path and size, so it's whole at once (CR115 is that moment). Then the patches, a page of 100 files at a time, and the contents file by file; sync.md and offline.spec.ts are here and readable while the rest arrive. A file whose patch is in but whose content isn't is its header and bars in the patch's hunk layout, in the line's tint (D45): both fixtures are new, so their bars are green, on the right. Never a spinner. The generated folder waits on .gitattributes: those files show only their header until it's known, so nothing flips from open to collapsed under you.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
