                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Submit review… (⇧S, or from the toolbar) opens this in the middle of the screen, so sending is never one click. An optional comment that goes on the pull request itself, not on a file; then what the review is, a comment by default: Tab out of the field, then 1 2 3. The button takes the choice's name and colour. ⌘↵ sends it all as one review, and the toolbar and the sidebar entry go with it.",
