                      "content": "Submitting needs no draft (CR85), so the toolbar shows up for those moments too. Sending: no count and no buttons. Refused with no draft open: GitHub's words, and Dismiss as well, because nothing is pending to keep it there; Dismiss keeps the choice, so ⇧S reopens it. Refused while another draft has turned up (begun in another tab or on github.com): no Try again, since that would send comments never shown; Edit review… lists them. While the draft it was sent against is open it stays CR76, with no Dismiss (D28).",
