              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Every build, one row each, reachable by anyone. The rows never reorder and the highlight changes no sizes, so the page doesn't shift when the system becomes known. It uses the landing page's toolbar without its Download, since you are already there. The landing page says nothing about signatures or permissions, so this page holds both: the Windows warnings, and the permission line under Sign in with GitHub. The footer is the one in Landing — githq.dev. The components below are shared with Landing — githq.dev and its mobile frame, which are built from them.",
