                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kzR9A",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "No words: the ghosts alone say it is loading, so they have to move. A soft highlight runs left to right along the skeleton bars themselves, never over the background between them: a full pass every 1.6 s, each row starting 80 ms after the one above, so the block reads as churning, never blinking. A row that arrives fades in over its ghost (150 ms) and the ghosts below move down. With animations off in Display (CH49) the ghosts stand still; they still read as rows to come. The same motion runs on every skeleton: list rows, board cards and columns, workflow rows, commit rows and the branch list.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
