              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The same app in a window of 375–430 px, moved around with a thumb, as picked by the owner. The top-left is where you are going: the places in a panel on a list, back to the list on an item. The top-right holds two buttons for this screen: options and new issue on a list, previous and next on an item. A command line floats at the bottom of every screen, wide on a list, the comment box and ⌘ side by side on an item, and ⌘ steps aside while you are inside a task. Drawn at 390 × 844 as an installed app. Screen codes are MB.",
