                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The places panel's foot is the phone's left end of the desktop's status bar (D12), so while anything downloads it says exactly what that segment says: the turning icon, items so far of all counted, and the time left once a pace is known (ES5); before the first pages, \"counting…\". The allowance gives way to it and comes back when all has arrived; offline and paused still come first (ES8). No screen gets a strip of its own: each says only what it itself waits for (MB139, MB140). Entries show no count until their open items are in.",
