                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The account tile at the places panel's foot opens a menu, as the user menu on the computer: who you are signed in as, Settings, and Sign out on its own below a line. The tile shows ⇕ where it said Sign out, so a stray tap at the foot only opens the menu. Settings opens the list of sections (MB146); Sign out asks once (MB157). When syncing of settings stopped, Settings says so in amber, as on the computer (T10).",
