                              "content": "As on the computer (H7): choosing a repository with templates brings them up in a menu at the bottom before more than a title is written, and starting in such a repository opens the form with them. A markdown template fills the body here. A form fills in here only where you can push (MB213); elsewhere ↗ opens GitHub's own form with the title carried over, because GitHub drops a form's labels and skips its required fields for an issue a non-maintainer creates through the API. Blank issues turned off stay listed, dimmed.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "$font",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
