              "type": "text",
              "id": "fImuS",
              "name": "Description",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A template for githq's documentation, built on VitePress: the shell every page shares and one page of each kind, so the mechanism can be built before the content is written. The text on the pages is placeholder in the right shape. Pages are Markdown in the repository; the sidebar, the outline, search, \"Edit this page\" and \"Updated\" come from the files and their git history, so the docs stay current with every merge. The look is the landing's: same top bar, type and colours, at reading width.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
